  "ruleText": "He-W 746.03 Withdrawal of Fair Hearing Requests. Households withdrawing fair hearing requests shall do so in writing or verbally.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for He-W 700) #5133, eff 5-2-91; ss by #6507, INTERIM, eff 5-1-97, EXPIRES: 8-29-97; ss by #6549, eff 8-1-97; ss by #8388, eff 7-8-05; ss by #10368, eff 7-8-13; ss by #13700, eff 7-25-23",
